{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "NKQOJDMR6QQCEVJZP4GKLUCKKCNQHTCN",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041112007",
    "title": "Same Sky: Sun and Moon",
    "enTitle": "Same Sky: Sun and Moon",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Hey!　聞いた？　今年の夏合宿、\n休養日に『無人島サバイバル大会』があるんですって！",
            "enText": "Hey! Did ya hear? This year's Summer Training Camp, on one of the days \noff there's going to be a 『Deserted Island Survival Competition』!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 228,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ、案内は見たけど……何を競うんだ？",
                    "enText": "Yeah, I saw……how are they competing?",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ、案内は見たけど……何を競うの？",
                    "enText": "Yeah, I saw……how are they competing?",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 96,
                    "pathId": -4580799340766511574
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 264,
                    "pathId": -7122730877379065089
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2455077988166374364,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "えーと……審査ポイントは『安心』『安全』、あとは\n『思わず羨ましくなるサバイバル』って書いてあるわね。",
            "enText": "Let's see……Points will be evaluated based on 『Safety』 『Security』 \nand 『A Survival Experience To Envy』, is what's written.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 353,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 358,
                    "pathId": -983387621732509791
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 29,
                    "pathId": -8295995567754760431
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 2593557024246898834
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4195600496209045666,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "サバイバルと聞いたら、傍観してなんかいられないわ！\nねえトレーナー、――Give it a try with me!",
            "enText": "When I hear the words, Survival, I can't just stand idly by! \nHey, Trainer――Give it a try with me!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 249,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -8656660834387801912
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2556220761571794097,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "というわけで、夏合宿中の休養日。\nデアリングハートとふたり、近くの無人島にやってきた。",
            "enText": "And so, it was now one of those days off during Summer Training \nCamp. Daring Heart and I had arrived at the Deserted Island.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 5064820701825974897
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 192,
                    "pathId": 1550118079743634178
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 8169661949014534462
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4843815644242887823,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "さ、着いたわね！\nこの美しい景色を堪能したいところだけれど……。",
            "enText": "And now, we're here! \nI'd like to admire this beautiful scenery but……",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 222,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "えっと、まずはベースキャンプの確保だよな",
                    "enText": "We should set up a base camp first, right?",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "えっと、まずはベースキャンプの確保だよね",
                    "enText": "We should set up a base camp first, right?",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 247,
                    "pathId": -5430747094551503732
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 139,
                    "pathId": 4893897501082570036
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -31843857307881753,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "That's right!　サバイバルは時間の使い方が勝負！\n昨晩話し合った通り、テキパキと進めていきましょ！",
            "enText": "That's right! Survival is a competition of how you \nspend your time! Just like we planned last night, \nlet's be efficient and take things one at a time!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 269,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 245,
                    "pathId": -8260621306680805280
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -2327481924714223178
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6651323698963196740,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "We're in luck!　ちょうどいい洞穴があったわね。\n今回はここにしましょ！",
            "enText": "We're in luck! This cave is just right, isn't it? \nFor now, let's start here!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 194,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 5252753880760466374
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 24,
                    "pathId": -49059694253348875
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3420208062892216292,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "水は川が来る途中にあったから……次は食料の確保ね。\nトレーナー、木の枝と、紐になりそうな蔦を集めてくれる？",
            "enText": "For water, there was a river on the way here so……next \nis gathering provisions. Trainer, can you gather some \ntree branches and vines that might be useable as rope?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 331,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "木の枝と蔦？",
                    "enText": "Branches and vines?",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 122,
                    "pathId": 4741597816401404140
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 5923023616863106291
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4321614314076219726,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Yes!　簡単な罠を作って、先に仕掛けておくのよ。\n許可もちゃんと取ってくれてるみたいだしね。",
            "enText": "Yes! We'll make a simple trap and set it up first. \nAnd we've already got permission for it.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 247,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 104,
                    "pathId": -6371524766083256458
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -7950102583005346899
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4378711387423471573,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "それが終わったら、山で食材を探しながら、\n漂流物checkよ！",
            "enText": "And after that, we'll head to the mountain. While searching for \ningredients, we'll check for anything useful that washed ashore!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 175,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 166,
                    "pathId": -8086567794036372668
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -3961660202283428675
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2293758509118345685,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Hey!　落とすわよ！",
            "enText": "Hey! I'm dropping it!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 72,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "オ、オーライ！",
                    "enText": "A-alright!",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 58,
                    "pathId": 7351710764778203194
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8344795051545931360,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "（ドサドサドサ！）",
            "enText": "(Shuffle shuffle)",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 56,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 6748482153127859629,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Nice catch!\nこれでビタミン兼デザートはgetね！",
            "enText": "Nice catch! \nAnd with this, we've got a little Vitamin Dessert!",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 171,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 151,
                    "pathId": 1779962251662389621
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 24,
                    "pathId": 7639074746304352329
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8523051323637913124,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "フフッ、この島は漂流物に恵まれてるわね。\n……I'm done!　さ、ハンモック完成よ！　乗ってみて。",
            "enText": "Fufuu, this island is blessed with luck when it comes to things \nwashed ashore. ……I'm done! Now the hammock's done! Try getting on.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 440,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "わ、わかった……いくぞ！",
                    "enText": "O-okay……here goes!",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "わ、わかった……いくよ！",
                    "enText": "O-okay……here goes!",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -8940439248582535249
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 64,
                    "pathId": -8166265762691472099
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6432830170126831142,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "と、意を決して、デアリングハートが漂流物で作った\nハンモックに寝転がった。",
            "enText": "And so, steeling myself, I climbed \nin to the hammock made by Daring Heart.",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 93,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 54,
                    "pathId": -3195736431184881119
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 26,
                    "pathId": -5733037711040856894
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6982863916469582979,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "どう？　寝心地は。",
            "enText": "How is it? Comfy?",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 70,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "最高すぎる……",
                    "enText": "Too comfy……",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1511203702839540510,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Glad to hear that!\nひと息入れたら、川の罠を引き上げに行きましょ！",
            "enText": "Glad to hear that! \nAfter a short break, let's go check on the river traps!",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 186,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "pathId": -3919210343348867464,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "魚に、フルーツ。\n水のboilingもよし、っと……。",
            "enText": "Fish, fruits. \nAnd the water is boiling……",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 162,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 243,
                    "pathId": 646858431242866975
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 142,
                    "pathId": 3894536300888605745
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2090509917035363884,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "フフッ……我ながら完璧ね！\n……Okay、ちょっと手を洗ってくるわ。",
            "enText": "Fufuu……perfect if I do say so myself! \n……Okay, I'm going to go wash my hands.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 253,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -3991335097519842599
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -1242179471772289590
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1672069150783379497,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "水の湧いていたほうへと歩いていく彼女を見送りながら、\n完璧に整ったベースキャンプを見渡す。",
            "enText": "As she headed off towards our water source, \nI looked over our perfectly organized base camp.",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 103,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（完璧だけど……これでいいのかな？）",
                    "enText": "(It's perfect……but will this win?)",
                    "nextBlock": 21
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -7237266434858383138
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3665062921166582612,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ご飯も、寝るところも完璧。\n文句の付け所はなにもない。",
            "enText": "The food and the sleeping arrangements were perfect. \nThere was nothing to complain about.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 80,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -3897033746901245780,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "だが、審査ポイントには『思わず羨ましくなるサバイバル』もある。\n……もしかしたら、『完璧』なだけでは足りない可能性も――",
            "enText": "But, one of the criteria was 『A Survival Experience To Envy』. \n……But maybe just being 『Perfect』 wouldn't be enough――",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 123,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -5826960412021034334,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "I'm back――Hey, what's up?\n眉間にしわが寄ってるわよ？",
            "enText": "I'm back――Hey, what's up? \nFurrowing your brow like that.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 249,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "え！？いや、なんでも……",
                    "enText": "Eh!? No, it's nothing……",
                    "nextBlock": 24
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 175,
                    "pathId": -1532129100508842527
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7174150904627144254
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -302571904945028774,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "……本当に？",
            "enText": "……Really?",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 115,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "うっ……その、心配しすぎかもなんだけど",
                    "enText": "Well, maybe I'm just overthinking……",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 49,
                    "pathId": 4748066519511688054
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5894036630347157952
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7984460368553429803,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ということで、さっき考えていたことを彼女に伝える。\n『勝つにはもうひと工夫必要なんじゃないか』、と……。",
            "enText": "I tell her what I was thinking earlier. \n『To win, don't we need something more?』……",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 150,
                    "pathId": 7447061223270849242
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -453264371290088319,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "…………あなたって。",
            "enText": "…………You really……",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 140,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 193,
                    "pathId": -6994528726368646947
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 910673307294243141,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "あなたって、本っ当に最高ね！\nYou're fire!",
            "enText": "You really are the best! \nYou're fire!",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 207,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "いや、考えすぎなだけかも……",
                    "enText": "No, I might just be overthinking……",
                    "nextBlock": 28
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -5976582959691232172
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 26,
                    "pathId": -433317531302053587
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3781107546392017780,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "いいえ、あなたの言う通りよ。求められていたのは、\n『完璧な』じゃなくて、『思わず羨ましくなるサバイバル』だもの！",
            "enText": "No, it's just like you said. What we were aiming for \nwasn't 『Perfect』, it was 『A Survival Experience To Envy』!",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 291,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 323,
                    "pathId": 77163236516796132
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 3784504037620108664
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4192505400761189909,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Alright, let's do this!\nそうと決まれば、時間はないわ。材料を探しに行きましょ！",
            "enText": "Alright, let's do this! Now that we've decided, \nthere's no time. Let's go look for some materials!",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 270,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "材料？",
                    "enText": "Materials?",
                    "nextBlock": 30
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 74,
                    "pathId": -84938152657524268
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 8004933508829816470
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3461989755875249536,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "ええ、飾るのよ。\nこのベースキャンプを！",
            "enText": "Yeah, I'll show it off. \nThis base camp!",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 138,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 110,
                    "pathId": -2066272626234322189
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -634681802532909753
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9024662695785107108,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "花や……空き缶に焚火を入れて、ライトを作るのもいいわね。\nとにかく、華やかでemotionalにしたいわ。",
            "enText": "Flowers and……maybe using empty cans almost like candles for \nlight. Anyways, we're just going for glamorous and emotional.",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 293,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -2990005027305413123
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3528022394771331555,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "勝利のためには……ここからが本番ね！\nAre you ready?",
            "enText": "For this competition……this is where things really start! \nAre you ready?",
            "nextBlock": 33,
            "origClipLength": 182,
            "voiceIdx": 24,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "イエス！",
                    "enText": "Yes!",
                    "nextBlock": 33
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
